uce and respond to criticism\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			12 \n			\n			\n			Unit 4\n\n			Building Relationships\n			\n			\n			Give someone positive feedback\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			13\n			\n			\n			Unit 4\n\n			Building Relationships\n			\n			\n			Explain how you handle anger\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			14\n			\n			\n			Unit 4\n\n			Building Relationships\n			\n			\n			Speaking skill:\n\n			Politely introduce criticism or an uncomfortable topic with “There’s something I need to bring up.”\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			15\n			\n			\n			Unit 4\n\n			Building Relationships\n			\n			\n			Grammar:\n\n			Cleft sentences: more on meaning and use\n			\n		\n	\n\n\n ', '國立中正紀念堂管理處', '100  臺北市中正區中山南路21號', 'W312教室', 25.0367564, 121.519047, '無資料', '無資料', '[]') ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `activity_name`='無資料', `description`='課程內容：進階閱讀文章為主題再搭配小組互動，依照指派的主題分組進行交談及討論。希望能增加英語口語流暢的機會及練習的場合。\n\n1/31、2/28、4/4停課\n\n\n	\n		\n			\n			課程名稱\n			\n			\n			實用英語進階班\n			\n			\n			授課老師\n			\n			\n			李宜玲Elaine\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			課\n\n			程\n\n			大\n\n			綱\n			\n			\n			次序\n			\n			\n			課 程 主 題\n			\n			\n			教  學  內  容 Connectivity 5 \n			\n		\n		\n			\n			1\n			\n			\n			Unit 2\n\n			Building Character\n			\n			\n			Discuss when telling a lie might be acceptable\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			2\n			\n			\n			Unit 2\n\n			Building Character\n			\n			\n			Accept responsibility and express regret\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			3\n			\n			\n			Unit 2\n\n			Building Character\n			\n			\n			Identify the origins of moral principles\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			4\n			\n			\n			Unit 2\n\n			Building Character\n			\n			\n			Speaking skill:\n\n			“What brings you here today?”\n\n			To formally invite someone to request help or express a need\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			5\n			\n			\n			Unit 2\n\n			Building Character\n			\n			\n			Grammar:\n\n			Adjective clauses\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			6\n			\n			\n			Unit 3\n\n			Confronting Difficulty\n			\n			\n			Describe how fear affects you physically\n			\n		\n		\n			\n			7\n			\n			\n			Unit 3\n\n			Confronting Difficulty\n